DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The Colorgraphic VoyagerVGA card is a CompactFlash removable video card.
     The ccffxxggaa driver allows its use under OpenBSD within the wscons(4) con‐
     sole framework.

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     intro(4), pcmcia(4), wscons(4), wsdisplay(4)

BBUUGGSS
     The ccffxxggaa driver forces the card into a 16bpp, 640x480, 72Hz mode on the
     VGA output connector.  It is not possible yet to select a different video
     mode, or use the S-Video output.

